SUMMARY:School Bus Hike: Caledon Trailway
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bruce Trail Club\nJoin us on a moderately paced hike o
 n flat terrain on the Caledon Trailway from the village of Caledon East pa
 st Albion Hills\, through the hamlet of Palgrave to Highway 9. Suitable fo
 r families and beginners or anyone wanting to enjoy a day out in the count
 ryside not far from Toronto on a not too challenging hike. Dropouts at 7 k
 m\, 10 km\, and 12 km. We'll have a refreshment stop in the downtown Bolto
 n heritage conservation district where the town of Bolton Mills was formed
  and there's a variety of options for hikers to enjoy before our ride back
  to York Mills.\n\nBus Fare: $25.00 Bruce Trail Conservancy Member\, $32.0
 0 Non-Members\, reduced fares for Children Under 12. Fares Includes a $1.0
 0 Donation to support the Bruce Trail Conservancy.\n\nNote you need to reg
 ister and pay your bus fare through the [Bruce Trail Hike Schedule](https:
 //hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-caledon-trailway-caledon-east-palgra
 ve/2026-08-15/). Registration will open at 8:00 PM Saturday August 1st.\n\
 nOur hikes proceed rain or shine and bus fares are non-refundable and they
  may not be transferred between seperate events. Please read our refund po
 licy linked from the above registration page before registering.
